          "jcr:created": "Wed Nov 29 2023 16:12:32 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The heel is the second most common site for pressure injury development.<sup>1</sup> The Heel Protector II is specifically designed to help reduce the risk of heel pressure injury.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Offloads the heel</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reduces plantar flexion contracture risk</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sequential Compression Device (SCD) compatible</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Dec 18 2023 15:06:02 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
